      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHUFFLE (6) could not have been more impressive a few runs back in his solid 16.82 win at this track over 300m then has finished in the placings in both runs since. Can return to winning form here if runs up to best figures. RISKY SPECIAL (1) goes very well this trip starting 26 times for nine wins and nine minors. Hit the frame latest (23.80) when second at this track in a NG. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. TIMELESS MISS (2) has been in the money at her last two runs, most recently when third beaten 3 lengths (23.84). Looks suited coming back in journey. Well-placed to take this out. WILGUNYA KNIGHT (8) placed last time (17.05) at this track in a NG, finishing second and beaten 1.5 lengths. Has already won three times from this draw.",
